/*  hole-11-67007.cufe: the model says some run reaches freed memory; `check` accepts it.
    chance true: CRASH 0xc0000005; chance false: same  */

Define chance as true permanently.
Bind series of number to f0, given (the series of number p0):
    p0 becomes a series of number.
    State p0.
    Return p0.
Done.
Bind void to f1:
    Pull a rabbit.
        Pull a rabbit.
            Pull a rabbit.
                Define v1 as a series of series of number.
            Done.
        Done.
    Done.
Done.
Cast f1 on ().
Define v2 as a series of number.
v2 becomes a series of number.
Cast f0 on (v2).
Cast f1 on ().
State v2.
Pull a rabbit.
    If chance:
        v2 becomes cast f0 on (v2).
    Done.
    Otherwise:
        Cast f1 on ().
    Done.
Done.

Define churn as a series of text.
Define tick as 0.
While tick is less than 400, repeat:
    Insert ("zzzzzzzz" joined to "yyyyyyyy") into churn.
    tick becomes tick + 1.
Done.
State v2.
